cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: dataset_tools
abstract: >-
  Tools for turning HELHEST robot recordings (ROS 2 bags) into a flat,
  learning-friendly dataset: synchronised camera frames, point clouds in the
  robot base frame, odometry, gravity alignment and proprioception, with a
  validator and a web viewer for the result.
authors:
